scale-set label and ARM node selector; no missing GitHub label is inferred.','Node names were observed only to compute stable SHA-256 identities and same-node counts; raw node names and addresses are not persisted here. Node architecture was not queried independently.','Scale-set status projection fields are absent and remain null; live min/max settings are read directly from spec.','This cut does not establish prior pool occupancy, all queued jobs, FIFO, fairness, the specific job dispatch cause, or any native startup/resource cause.','No events were read because every selected actual runner Pod was Ready. This does not assert that no historical warning ever occurred.','The GitHub repository runner endpoint supplies one complete page; only ARM runner records were retained. Other registered runner counts appear solely in the pagination completeness proof.','The byte limit is a parser bound on the returned GitHub response, not a claim of a streaming transport cutoff.']}
